Home Brew Software, Inc., a non-profit software group, is pleased to
announce the availability of Amiga Hack Lite version 2.8.1 (plays great!
less killing!).  Hack Lite 2 is a dungeon adventure game, in the noble
tradition of Rogue, Hack, Larn, Moria, NetHack and, of course, Hack Lite
version 1.

Changes from Hack Lite 2.8.0 (our first release):

*   Support for user Keymaps (it used to be hardcoded :-( )

*   Various minor fixes to Game.

*   Various minor fixes to HackInstall and HackConfig.


Hack Lite 2.8.1 can be downloaded from the Deep Thought bulletin board,
(919) 859-5316, and has been submitted for inclusion in the Fred Fish
library.  It may also be accessed via ftp from ftp.etsu.edu (in
/aminet/game/role, name HackLite2_1.lha), or any other mirror of
amiga.physik.unizh.ch.	On BIX, it lives in the amiga.games listings
section.  Soon to appear on other BBSs near you!

The release of Hack Lite 2 for MS-DOS is (still) expected soon.

